<title>UK: BOE allots 355 mln stg in repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 355 mln stg in repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Monday it provided the UK money market with 355 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted all 355 million stg in repos to June 2 in early operations having forecast a money market shortage of 900 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
